# Branch Node

**Schema `node_type`:** `branch`

## Documentation

{{{docs_branch}}}

## Branch Structure

A branch node uses the `branches` array at the node level (not inside `properties`).
Each branch has 2-10 items: up to 9 conditional branches and 1 default branch (must be last).

